    "text": "By Winston Rogers ,\n5 hours ago PRINCE GEORGE'S COUNTY, Md (7News) — A man injured after a fire at a two-story home in Prince George's County, Maryland, on Wednesday was taken into custody, according to county fire officials. Officials said the man was seriously injured after a fire broke out at a two-story single-family home... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
